@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

title SCM Platform - AWS Deployment (Network and Security View)

cloud "Internet" as Internet
node "Route 53" as Route53
node "AWS WAF" as WAF
node "Application Load Balancer\nPublic Subnets" as ALB

frame "VPC (10.0.0.0/16)" {
  node "Public Subnet A" as PubA
  node "Public Subnet B" as PubB

  frame "Private App Subnets" {
    node "ECS Fargate Services\nGateway + Microservices" as ECS
    node "ECS Service Discovery\n(Cloud Map / Eureka)" as Discovery
  }

  frame "Private Data Subnets" {
    database "RDS PostgreSQL" as RDS
    queue "MSK / Kafka Broker" as Kafka
  }

  node "NAT Gateway" as NAT
  node "Secrets Manager" as Secrets
  node "CloudWatch" as CloudWatch
}

Internet --> Route53 : DNS query
Route53 --> WAF : web traffic
WAF --> ALB : allow filtered requests
ALB --> ECS : HTTPS/TCP target groups

ECS --> Discovery : service registration/discovery
ECS --> RDS : JDBC (restricted SG)
ECS --> Kafka : producer/consumer
ECS --> Secrets : fetch DB/JWT/SMTP secrets
ECS --> CloudWatch : logs and metrics
ECS --> NAT : outbound internet egress

note right of ALB
  Security groups:
  - Inbound 443 from internet
  - Outbound only to ECS targets
end note

note right of RDS
  Data boundary:
  - Private subnet only
  - No public IP
  - Access only from ECS SG
end note

@enduml

